invariant: INV-55
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the KeyUpdate past a full run fails the read with CH_EPROTO, the
  code of every protocol failure, so a caller cannot report the run limit
  as the reason the session ended. bin/unit requires CH_KEY_UPDATE_LIMIT.

--- old
        return CH_KEY_UPDATE_LIMIT;
--- new
        return CH_EPROTO;
